"""Bitcoin Vibes console.

A local web console for a Bitcoin Core fork that reshapes itself around its
operator's wishes. You type what you want Bitcoin to be; a coding agent
(the `claude` CLI) edits this repository accordingly; the console snapshots
the change as a `vibe:` git commit, rebuilds bitcoind, and restarts the node.

Stdlib only. Binds to 127.0.0.1 and requires a per-session key for every
request, so random web pages can't inject vibes into your node.
"""

